  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sOb6wz3.png\" width=\"656\" height=\"244\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;從 1.21 版本開始，此模組將僅支援 NeoForge</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>描述</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Project: Vibrant Journeys 是一款擴充的世界生成模組，專注於透過添加細微細節來改善原版生物群系，讓世界感覺更加生動且充滿動態！</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/HgsxmEN.png\" width=\"494\" height=\"540\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">功能特色 (1.18+)</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>地表覆蓋物</strong>：在穿越 Minecraft 景觀的旅程中，發現<strong>岩石</strong>、<strong>樹枝</strong>、<strong>落葉</strong>、<strong>骨骼</strong>、<strong>松果</strong>、<strong>貝殼</strong>以及<strong>更多</strong>！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>更活躍的生物群系</strong>：<strong>高</strong> <strong>草</strong> <strong>變體</strong>、<strong>倒下的樹木</strong>、<strong>樹皮蘑菇</strong>、<strong>&nbsp;</strong>以及<strong>下界植物群</strong>！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>優化</strong> <strong>湖泊</strong>：有了<strong>海草</strong>、<strong>蘆葦</strong>和<strong>睡蓮</strong>，湖泊與池塘變得不再那麼無聊！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>優化</strong> <strong>海灘</strong>：海灘上裝飾著<strong>海濱麥草</strong>、<strong>貝殼</strong>和<strong>沙灘草</strong>！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>更好的毀壞下界傳送門</strong>：毀壞的傳送門現在更具風格化，並提供靈魂沙、玄武岩、扭曲與深紅色的變體！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>小改進</strong>：樹葉下有<strong>蜘蛛網</strong>、<strong>熱帶</strong> <strong>魚</strong>會在叢林中生成，以及<strong>更多！</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/XcGjKMc.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"596\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/yOUCkgQ.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/BNYj5cS.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/pAoqBqe.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/84eaff1e-d58c-4c2a-bf2a-5fcbd0f36c46.png\" width=\"1086\" height=\"180\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Project: Vibrant Journeys 採用&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcreativecommons.org%252flicenses%252fby-nc-sa%252f4.0%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">創用 CC 姓名標示-非商業性-相同方式分享 4.0 國際</a>授權</strong></p>",
